      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 523897127,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@m-tmatma You mean because of the Protocol column and Info column? That's the only difference right?\n\nI agree that it's a nice touch but I'm not in favor of adding a dissector that doesn't dissect anything (!2073). That I won't merge, some other developer would have to do that.\n\nIMO setting the columns should be implemented in the XML dissector too. Using the port number would be trivial, but ideally it would be set from parsing the XML. I don't know how difficult that would be though.\n\nWhat do you think?",
